WEBVTT

00:03:28.940 --> 00:03:30.998
they have a common bond
and shared purpose,

00:03:31.022 --> 00:03:33.173
a commitment to end violence
against children,

00:03:33.197 --> 00:03:35.911
and they are taking action
to try and get their countries

00:03:35.935 --> 00:03:40.026
on a pathway to zero violence
against children by 2030.

00:03:40.612 --> 00:03:44.596
And many other countries,
cities and states are joining them,

00:03:44.620 --> 00:03:45.887
all over the world.

00:03:46.739 --> 00:03:49.570
But what does it really mean,
what does it mean in practice?

00:03:49.594 --> 00:03:51.839
When they make that commitment,
what do they do?

00:03:51.863 --> 00:03:54.537
It means high-level political
commitment and leadership.

00:03:54.561 --> 00:03:57.095
Enacting and implementing legislation.

00:03:57.921 --> 00:04:00.358
And launching initiatives,
changing policy,